# game/script.rpy:11
translate japanese start_44bdb198:

    # system "Okay then, let's get started!"
    system "さて、それでは始めましょう！"

# game/script.rpy:20
translate japanese start_d1f798f2:

    # "I just moved to a new city to start my career as an indie game developer."
    "私はインディーズ ゲーム開発者としてのキャリアを始めるために新しい都市に引っ越したばかりです。"

# game/script.rpy:21
translate japanese start_7af065ac:

    # "Until recently, I was living with my parents and working a corporate job that I hated."
    "私はつい最近まで両親と同居し、大嫌いな会社勤めをしていました。"

# game/script.rpy:22
translate japanese start_098d1f53:

    # "I decided to take a leap of faith and move to a new city to pursue my dream of making games."
    "私はゲームを作るという夢を追求するために、思い切って新しい街に移住することにしました。"

# game/script.rpy:23
translate japanese start_516b947f:

    # "Money is tight though, so I decided to take advantage of the extra room in my apartment and find a roommate."
    "しかしお金が厳しいので、アパートの余分な部屋を利用してルームメイトを探すことにしました。"

# game/script.rpy:25
translate japanese start_cf4e5812:

    # "I put up an ad online and got a decent amount of responses, but none of them really panned out."
    "オンラインに広告を掲載し、かなりの数の反響を得ましたが、どれもあまり良い結果にはなりませんでした。"

# game/script.rpy:26
translate japanese start_c4c9f887:

    # "There was this one guy who I thought was perfect. He didn't try to haggle over rent and said he wouldn't even be home often."
    "私が完璧だと思った一人の男がいました。彼は家賃を値切ろうともせず、家にもあまり帰らないと言いました。"

# game/script.rpy:27
translate japanese start_a82f85af:

    # "But turns out he just wanted to use the apartment as a drug den where he could stash his weed and have his friends over all the time."
    "しかし、彼はそのアパートを麻薬の巣窟として使いたかっただけで、そこに大麻を隠して、いつでも友達を泊めることができたかったことが分かりました。"

# game/script.rpy:28
translate japanese start_2c2b7240:

    # "Another couple asked if I would be willing to join their polyamorous relationship as a third partner."
    "別のカップルは、私に第3のパートナーとして彼らのポリアモリー関係に参加してくれないかと尋ねました。"

# game/script.rpy:29
translate japanese start_384a76d5:

    # "Of course, I declined."
    "もちろん断りました。"

# game/script.rpy:30
translate japanese start_6e149907:

    # "I just wanted a normal roommate that I would get along with and wouldn't cause any trouble."
    "私はただ仲良くて問題を起こさない普通のルームメイトが欲しかっただけです。"

# game/script.rpy:31
translate japanese start_2749f60f:

    # "After a few hours and a headache, I finally found a person that looked decent."
    "数時間かけて頭が痛くなった後、ようやくまともそうな人を見つけた。"

# game/script.rpy:33
translate japanese start_e67b695a:

    # "His name was Robin."
    "彼の名前はロビンでした。"

# game/script.rpy:34
translate japanese start_0aff7e7d:

    # "Based on our conversation, I could sort of tell he was an introvert, which would be perfect since I don't want a loud roommate."
    "私たちの会話から、彼が内向的であることがなんとなくわかりました。私はうるさいルームメイトを望んでいないので、それは完璧です。"

# game/script.rpy:35
translate japanese start_6119c686:

    # "He was also willing to move in right away."
    "彼もすぐに入居したいとのことでした。"

# game/script.rpy:36
translate japanese start_13af98a2:

    # "Just to be safe though, I asked him to send me a picture of himself along with ID before taking a deposit."
    "ただし、念のため、デポジットを受け取る前に身分証明書と一緒に自分の写真を送ってもらうように頼みました。"

# game/script.rpy:38
translate japanese start_d837d04c:

    # "He sent a photo of himself and, to my surprise, he looked more like a girl than a guy."
    "彼は自分の写真を送ってきましたが、驚いたことに、彼は男というよりも女の子のように見えました。"

# game/script.rpy:40
translate japanese start_fd7438f2:

    # "He had curly black hair, a small, pointed face, and a soft, feminine looking body. His eyes were light blue and his lips were full and pouty."
    "彼はカールした黒髪、小さく尖った顔、柔らかく女性らしい体をしていました。彼の目は水色で、唇はふっくらしていました。"

# game/script.rpy:41
translate japanese start_190f0c50:

    # "After looking at the photo, I wasn't quite sure what to think."
    "写真を見た後、何を考えるべきかよく分かりませんでした。"

# game/script.rpy:42
translate japanese start_cf154383:

    # "He definitely didn't look like any of the other guys I interviewed, and his appearance was very ambiguous."
    "彼は私がインタビューした他の男性とはまったく似ていませんでした、そして彼の外見は非常に曖昧でした。"

# game/script.rpy:43
translate japanese start_30c556dc:

    # "However, it's not like I'm looking for a roommate based on their looks, and he seemed like a perfectly nice guy over our messages."
    "しかし、見た目に基づいてルームメイトを探しているわけではありませんし、メッセージを聞いている限り、彼は完全に良い人のように見えました。"

# game/script.rpy:45
translate japanese start_2fa4bf8f:

    # "Today is his move-in day."
    "今日は彼の引っ越しの日です。"

# game/script.rpy:48
translate japanese start_b3f3453c:

    # "I'm waiting outside of the apartment building for Robin to arrive."
    "ロビンが到着するのをアパートの外で待っています。"

# game/script.rpy:49
translate japanese start_bce81262:

    # pro "He should be here any minute now."
    pro "彼は今すぐにもここにいるはずです。"

# game/script.rpy:50
translate japanese start_dc56ccbb:

    # "I figured it would make a good first impression to greet him at the door and help him move his stuff in."
    "私は、玄関で彼に挨拶し、荷物を中に運ぶのを手伝うことが良い第一印象を与えるだろうと考えました。"

# game/script.rpy:52
translate japanese start_967594a5:

    # "After a few minutes, a car pulls up."
    "数分後、一台の車がやって来た。"

# game/script.rpy:53
translate japanese start_d6264076:

    # pro "This must be him."
    pro "これは彼に違いない。"

# game/script.rpy:58
translate japanese start_c30e47d8:

    # "Robin steps out of the car wearing a black cropped hoodie and shorts."
    "ロビンは黒いクロップドパーカーとショートパンツを着て車から降ります。"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate japanese start_cdb9490f:

    # "His clothes hugged his thin figure tightly and I could see the shape of his hips and chest."
    "彼の服は彼の細い体をしっかりと包み込み、彼の腰と胸の形が見えました。"

# game/script.rpy:60
translate japanese start_e87b5003:

    # "I felt a little nervous as he walked towards me, I've never met someone who looked like him before."
    "彼が私に向かって歩いてくるとき、私は少し緊張しました。今まで彼のような人に会ったことがありませんでした。"

# game/script.rpy:61
translate japanese start_e976a923:

    # pro "Hey! Are you Robin?"
    pro "おい！ロビンさんですか？"

# game/script.rpy:62
translate japanese start_58c0639d:

    # voice voiceline1
    # robin "Yeah, h-hi."
    voice voiceline1
    robin "はい、こんにちは。"

# game/script.rpy:64
translate japanese start_2469f00b:

    # pro "It's nice to meet you. I'm [protagonist_name]."
    pro "お会い出来て嬉しいです。私は[protagonist_name]です。"

# game/script.rpy:65
translate japanese start_03af5f79:

    # voice voiceline2
    # robin "It's nice to meet you too!"
    voice voiceline2
    robin "あなたにも会えてうれしいです！"

# game/script.rpy:67
translate japanese start_072c89b2:

    # pro "Is this all the stuff you're bringing? I can help you take it inside."
    pro "持ってくるものはこれだけですか？中に入れるのを手伝ってあげるよ。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate japanese start_c565c459:

    # voice voiceline3
    # robin "Oh don't worry about it, I can handle it myself."
    voice voiceline3
    robin "ああ、心配しないでください、私は自分でそれを扱うことができます。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate japanese start_bb5869e9:

    # pro "I insist."
    pro "私は主張します。"

# game/script.rpy:73
translate japanese start_70e4b7e7:

    # voice voiceline4
    # robin "Oh... okay."
    voice voiceline4
    robin "ああ...わかりました。"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate japanese start_9632bdc3:

    # "He softly smiles for a moment before turning around to grab his bag."
    "彼は一瞬静かに微笑んでから、振り返ってバッグを掴みました。"

# game/script.rpy:77
translate japanese start_6b88c189:

    # "As he grabbed his bags, his shorts slightly slipped down."
    "彼がカバンを掴むと、ショーツがわずかに滑り落ちた。"

# game/script.rpy:78
translate japanese start_e1341e80:

    # voice voiceline5
    # robin "I only have two boxes to bring to my room, so we can each take one if you'd like..."
    voice voiceline5
    robin "部屋に持っていける箱が 2 つしかないので、よかったらそれぞれ 1 つずつ持って行ってもいいですか..."

# game/script.rpy:80
translate japanese start_c46f6f4b:

    # pro "Uh... for sure."
    pro "ああ...確かに。"

# game/script.rpy:81
translate japanese start_a8db3472:

    # "Even his voice is super feminine, it's almost surprising that he's actually a guy."
    "彼の声も非常に女性的で、彼が実際に男性であることはほとんど驚くべきことです。"

# game/script.rpy:83
translate japanese start_1c64b542:

    # "I pick up one of the boxes and take it inside."
    "私は箱の一つを手に取り、中に入れます。"

# game/script.rpy:86
translate japanese start_2a248567:

    # pro "So Robin, where did you live before this?"
    pro "それで、ロビン、これの前はどこに住んでいましたか？"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate japanese start_f9c909df:

    # voice voiceline6
    # robin "I lived in New York City, in an apartment."
    voice voiceline6
    robin "私はニューヨーク市のアパートに住んでいました。"

# game/script.rpy:89
translate japanese start_792e9ee2:

    # pro "New York!? Why would you ever want to leave that place!?"
    pro "ニューヨーク！？なぜその場所を離れたいと思うのですか？"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate japanese start_0284397a:

    # voice voiceline7
    # robin "Oh, uh..."
    voice voiceline7
    robin "ああ、ああ..."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate japanese start_e325e108:

    # voice voiceline8
    # robin "I guess a change of pace would be the best way to describe it."
    voice voiceline8
    robin "それを説明するのに最適な方法は、ペースの変化だと思います。"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate japanese start_48213e3e:

    # pro "A change of pace?"
    pro "気分転換？"

# game/script.rpy:97
translate japanese start_d0c34081:

    # voice voiceline9
    # robin "Yeah..."
    voice voiceline9
    robin "うん..."

# game/script.rpy:99
translate japanese start_43c9059f:

    # voice voiceline10
    # robin "I, um, just needed a quiet place for my career."
    voice voiceline10
    robin "私は、キャリアのために静かな場所が必要だったのです。"

# game/script.rpy:101
translate japanese start_d2fc0434:

    # voice voiceline11
    # robin "Somewhere where I don't have to worry about the problems that come with a big city."
    voice voiceline11
    robin "大都市に伴う問題を心配する必要のない場所。"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate japanese start_3a775df7:

    # pro "Oh that makes sense."
    pro "ああ、それは理にかなっています。"

# game/script.rpy:104
translate japanese start_eea1ce3b:

    # pro "I've never really lived in a big city before, so I guess I wouldn't know what it's like."
    pro "私はこれまで大きな都市に住んだことがないので、それがどのようなものであるかわからないと思います。"

# game/script.rpy:105
translate japanese start_0b6b382d:

    # voice voiceline12
    # robin "It's not all bad, but it's definitely not for everyone."
    voice voiceline12
    robin "それは悪いことばかりではありませんが、すべての人に当てはまるわけではありません。"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate japanese start_420bb9ed:

    # pro "I can imagine."
    pro "想像できます。"

# game/script.rpy:109
translate japanese start_549333f9:

    # "We set down the boxes in his room while continuing our conversation."
    "私たちは会話を続けながら、彼の部屋に箱を置きました。"

# game/script.rpy:111
translate japanese start_0d3f177d:

    # pro "So what do you do for work?"
    pro "それで、仕事は何をしますか？"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate japanese start_0ee723c5:

    # voice voiceline13
    # robin "I uh..."
    voice voiceline13
    robin "私は..."

# game/script.rpy:114
translate japanese start_efafffc3:

    # voice voiceline14
    # robin "W-work from home."
    voice voiceline14
    robin "在宅Wワーク。"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate japanese start_03d69cac:

    # pro "Oh that's convenient, I'm in the same sort of situation myself."
    pro "ああ、便利ですね、私も同じような状況です。"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate japanese start_d4d32ad5:

    # pro "I'm an indie game dev, so I basically can work from wherever I want provided I have my computer and an internet connection."
    pro "私はインディーズ ゲームの開発者なので、コンピューターとインターネット接続があれば、基本的にどこからでも作業できます。"

# game/script.rpy:119
translate japanese start_d8c089ef:

    # voice voiceline15
    # robin "Wow, that's so cool!"
    voice voiceline15
    robin "うわー、すごいですね！"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate japanese start_4f42f31f:

    # voice voiceline16
    # robin "A game developer seems like a dream job to be honest."
    voice voiceline16
    robin "正直に言うと、ゲーム開発者は夢のような仕事のように思えます。"

# game/script.rpy:123
translate japanese start_4e92ab7a:

    # pro "Eh, it's alright. Not the most stable career I could be in, but I've always wanted to make games and I finally got my opportunity to do so."
    pro "えー、大丈夫です。あまり安定したキャリアではありませんでしたが、ゲームを作りたいとずっと思っていて、ようやくその機会を得ることができました。"

# game/script.rpy:124
translate japanese start_df40652f:

    # voice voiceline17
    # robin "What were you doing before this?"
    voice voiceline17
    robin "この前は何をしていましたか？"

# game/script.rpy:126
translate japanese start_c7e3aeb3:

    # pro "I was working as a software engineer for a big tech company."
    pro "私は大手テクノロジー企業でソフトウェアエンジニアとして働いていました。"

# game/script.rpy:127
translate japanese start_ef47dfa2:

    # pro "I didn't like the corporate environment, so I decided to go indie and make my own games."
    pro "会社の環境が気に入らなかったので、インディーズで自分のゲームを作ることにしました。"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate japanese start_12532baa:

    # voice voiceline18
    # robin "That's really brave of you."
    voice voiceline18
    robin "本当に勇敢ですね。"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate japanese start_ab4f135f:

    # pro "Thanks, I guess."
    pro "ありがとう、たぶん。"

# game/script.rpy:132
translate japanese start_a8ce8053:

    # "We finished unpacking Robin's belongings."
    "私たちはロビンの荷物の開梱を終えました。"

# game/script.rpy:135
translate japanese start_d881c139:

    # voice voiceline19
    # robin "Thank you for your help [protagonist_name]."
    voice voiceline19
    robin "[protagonist_name] ご協力ありがとうございます。"

# game/script.rpy:137
translate japanese start_155288c7:

    # voice voiceline20
    # robin "I really appreciate it, I've never really moved to a new place all on my own before so I was a little nervous."
    voice voiceline20
    robin "本当に感謝しています。これまで一人で新しい場所に引っ越したことがなかったので、少し緊張していました。"

# game/script.rpy:139
translate japanese start_5fefea31:

    # pro "No problem! Is there anything else you need help with?"
    pro "問題ない！他に何か手助けが必要なことはありますか?"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate japanese start_f5d9e168:

    # voice voiceline21
    # robin "Um, no I think that was everything..."
    voice voiceline21
    robin "いや、それがすべてだったと思います..."

# game/script.rpy:144
translate japanese start_5835cd3b:

    # pro "Well if you need anything, I'll be in my room."
    pro "そうですね、何か必要なことがあれば、部屋にいますよ。"

# game/script.rpy:145
translate japanese start_de544ff9:

    # voice voiceline22
    # robin "O-okay. I'll let you know if I do."
    voice voiceline22
    robin "わかりました。そうなったらお知らせします。"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate japanese start_a4e049ca:

    # pro "Nice meeting you Robin!"
    pro "ロビンに会えて嬉しいよ！"

# game/script.rpy:148
translate japanese start_18ea6b47:

    # pro "I think we'll get along just fine."
    pro "私たちはうまくやっていけると思う。"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate japanese start_5fdc5442:

    # voice voiceline23
    # robin "Nice meeting you too!"
    voice voiceline23
    robin "あなたにも会えて嬉しいです！"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate japanese start_bc93f35f:

    # "Robin smiled at me before I turned and walked back to my room."
    "私が向きを変えて部屋に戻る前に、ロビンは私に微笑んでくれました。"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate japanese start_8f2a8261:

    # "I'm glad he seems like a nice person, but his appearance and demeanor really caught me off guard."
    "彼がいい人そうなのは嬉しいのですが、彼の見た目と態度には本当に不意を突かれました。"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate japanese start_45e9ec9f:

    # "He also seemed weirdly vague about why he moved and his career, am I sure he's not some serial killer looking for his next victim?"
    "また、彼は自分が引っ越した理由や自分のキャリアについても妙に曖昧なようだった。彼は次の犠牲者を探している連続殺人犯ではないのだろうか？"

# game/script.rpy:157
translate japanese start_e988b9e5:

    # "But then again, he seemed pretty nervous to move here so maybe he was just being awkward or shy."
    "しかし、繰り返しになりますが、彼はここに移動することにかなり緊張しているようだったので、おそらく彼は単にぎこちなかったり恥ずかしがったりしていたのかもしれません。"

# game/script.rpy:158
translate japanese start_e8ed8bb2:

    # "And he is going to be living with me for who knows how long, so it would be best for the both of us to just get along well."
    "そして、彼はいつまで私と一緒に暮らすことになるので、お互い仲良くやっていくのが一番良いと思います。"

# game/script.rpy:159
translate japanese start_bcd2a5c1:

    # "It's strange though. He acts like a girl and he's very pretty like one too. The way he acts is... cute. Almost like a fembo-"
    "不思議ですけどね。彼は女の子のように振る舞い、女の子のようにとてもかわいいです。仕草が…かわいいんです。まるでフェンボのようだ――"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate japanese start_805e41bc:

    # pro "Nope! No. That's inappropriate and weird to think about."
    pro "いいえ！いいえ、それは不適切であり、考えるのも奇妙です。"

# game/script.rpy:163
translate japanese start_e953eec0:

    # "I decide to get some work done for the day."
    "私はその日の仕事を終わらせることにしました。"

# game/script.rpy:171
translate japanese start_ac4459be:

    # pro "Ah shit, my back..."
    pro "ああ、くそ、背中が…"

# game/script.rpy:172
translate japanese start_2a674f6d:

    # "I've been working on my project for a few hours and it's starting to get late."
    "数時間プロジェクトに取り組んでいますが、遅くなり始めています。"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate japanese start_f1559be7:

    # "Maybe I should take a break to grab some dinner."
    "夕食をとるために休憩を取ったほうがいいかもしれません。"

# game/script.rpy:174
